captured_item.description:
A coarse flax waist is cinched with a watervine hemp rope.

{{cyan|Painted: This item is painted with a scene from the life of the ancient sultan {{magenta|Artaxerdates III}}:

Deep in the Nomads' District of Anenna, Artaxerdates III discovered Turched Knot. There he befriended birds and fought for everlasting glory.}}

{{rules|+45 reputation with the Cult of Artaxerdates III}}

{{K|Weight: 5 lbs.}}

The crown is crushed by wear into a hundred papery creases, and the brim is stained in the fractal signatures of sweat and salt.

{{rules|Slender: This item weighs less than normal.}}

{{K|Weight: 0 lbs.}}

Wrought iron was moulded to a crescent for scything the rough hides of watervine.

{{rules|Strength Bonus Cap: 2
Weapon Class: Axe (cleaves armor on critical hit)}}

{{K|Weight: 5 lbs.}}

